    {
      "id": "claim_87b46c3366e245729cf3e5265a5ef6c4",
      "statement": "Casbin uses keyMatch2 for URL path matching (so /api/v1/users/:id matches /api/v1/users/42), a wildcard * on the HTTP method to cover all verbs in one row, and deny-override as the policy effect; partner-timesheet authorization is the canonical deny-override example in the policy file.",
